## Decisions Made

- **Top bar = contextual page header, NOT global chrome** (Director q9a). Resolves the
  "episode-specific MODE button in a global bar" smell: on the episode page the bar
  IS the episode's header.
- **MODE (governance) → Episode Settings** (Director). It's a per-episode setting, not
  header identity. Consequence: the global-default mode UI control disappears when no
  episode is open — accepted (per-episode workflow).
- **Archived marker = sand title colour + tooltip**, not a status chip (Director). Reuses
  `--accent-warning` (the old chip's colour). Reinforced in the list by the existing
  TRASH tab + "archived" sub-label + Delete-forever button.
- **Final cut pill removed entirely** — the pipeline carries the stitch signal (Director q7).
- **Reuse `DropdownMenu` primitive** for the kebab; **portal-slot** for 2c — anti-additivity
  (no new bespoke components).
- **Commit small verified checkpoints** (Director q5/q10a). Branch-only; no push/merge yet.

---

